0827                         ; The depletion of energy from the space ship’s main storage bank 
0828                         ; and its shields is an important function in this program. The following
0829                         ; group of subroutines is called to delete the energy from the ship, 
0830                         ; and to check the energy level of the ship. The subroutine labeled 
0831                         ; ELOS deletes the amount of energy contained in the index register 
0832                         ; from the ship’s protective shields. The least significant half of the 
0833                         ; energy to be deleted must be stored in the most significant half of 
0834                         ; the index register, and the most significant half of the energy must 
0835                         ; be stored in the least significant half of the index register. By switching
0836                         ; the two eight bit values around in this manner, the STX instruction
0837                         ; will store the energy in the desired order in memory (the least 
0838                         ; significant half in the lower address of the pair of memory locations). 
0839                         ; The amount of energy deleted is first output to the display device to 
0840                         ; inform the operator of the loss. The shield energy level is checked, 
0841                         ; and if sufficient, the energy is removed from the shield. If the level 
0842                         ; is not high enough to absorb the loss, the remaining shield energy is 
0843                         ; transferred to the main supply, and the loss is taken from the main 
0844                         ; storage bank. If at this time the main supply is not enough, the ship 
0845                         ; is out of energy, and the game is over. Otherwise, since the shield 
0846                         ; energy is zero, the warning message is output and an additional 25 
0847                         ; percent of the energy loss is depleted from the main supply as a 
0848                         ; penalty. The listing of ELOS and its supporting subroutines is shown 
0849                         ; next. 
0850                         
0851 0798 df 2a              ELOS        STX         STORE3      ; Save energy value 
0852 079a ce 00 2a                       LDX         #STORE3     ; Set pointer to value to be converted
0853 079d c6 02                          LDAB        #$02        ; Double precision conversion
0854 079f bd 05 29                       JSR         BINDEC      ; Convert to BCD for message
0855 07a2 ce 03 13                       LDX         #Msg19a+3   ; Set pntr to least signif digit of energy 
0856 07a5 c6 04                          LDAB        #$04        ; Set digit counter
0857 07a7 bd 06 62                       JSR         DIGPRT      ; Put digit in message
0858 07aa ce 02 ff                       LDX         #MSG19      ; Set pointer to energy loss message
0859 07ad 8d e6                          BSR         LR6         ; Print energy loss message
0860 07af de 2a                          LDX         STORE3      ; Restore value for routines
0861 07b1 df 26                          STX         STORE1      ; To follow
0862                         
0863 07b3 8d 23              ELS1        BSR         CKSD        ; Is shield energy sufficient?
0864 07b5 24 32                          BCC         FMSD        ; Yes, delete from shields and return 
0865                         
0866 07b7 de 44              SDO1        LDX         DVSE        ; Move shield energy to main storage
0867 07b9 df 26                          STX         STORE1      ; Remove energy from shields
0868 07bb 8d 2c                          BSR         FMSD        ; Fetch energy to be deleted
0869 07bd 8d 41                          BSR         TOMN        ; Move shield energy to main storage
0870 07bf de 2a                          LDX         STORE3      ; 
0871 07c1 df 26                          STX         STORE1      ; Store for routines
0872                         
0873 07c3 8d 17              SDO         BSR         CKMN        ; Energy enough?
0874 07c5 25 53                          BCS         EOUT1       ; No, ship out of energy
0875 07c7 8d 24                          BSR         FMMN        ; Yes, take from main
0876 07c9 ce 03 15                       LDX         #MSG20      ; Print WARNING!
0877 07cc 8d c7                          BSR         LR6         ; DANGER - SHIELD ENERGY 000
0878 07ce c6 02                          LDAB        #$02        ; Divide energy loss by 2 twice
0879 07d0 8d 3d                          BSR         DVD         ; To divide by 4
0880 07d2 8d 08                          BSR         CKMN        ; Enough main energy for penalty?
0881 07d4 25 44                          BCS         EOUT1       ; No, out of energy message
0882 07d6 20 15                          BRA         FMMN        ; Yes, take penalty and return
0883                         
0884 07d8 de 68              CKSD        LDX         PDVSE       ; Check shield energy level
0885 07da 20 02                          BRA         CK1         ; Against requested level
0886                         
0887 07dc de 66              CKMN        LDX         PDVME       ; Check main energy level 
0888                         
0889 07de a6 01              CK1         LDAA        $01,X       ; Fetch most significant half
0890 07e0 91 27                          CMPA        STORE1+$1   ; Is most significant half =0?
0891 07e2 26 35                          BNE         ELOS1       ; No, return with flags set up
0892 07e4 a6 00              CK2         LDAA        0,X         ; If > =, return with C flag set
0893 07e6 91 26                          CMPA        STORE1      ; If less than, C flag reset
0894 07e8 39                             RTS                     ; Return
0895                         
0896 07e9 de 68              FMSD        LDX         PDVSE       ; Set pointer to shield energy
0897 07eb 20 02                          BRA         FM1         ; Subtract energy from shields
0898                         
0899 07ed de 66              FMMN        LDX         PDVME       ; Set pointer to main storage 
0900                         
0901 07ef a6 00              FM1         LDAA        0,X         ; Fetch least significant half of energy
0902 07f1 90 26                          SUBA        STORE1      ; Subtract least significant half of loss
0903 07f3 a7 00                          STAA        0,X         ; Return to storage
0904 07f5 a6 01                          LDAA        $01,X       ; Fetch most significant half of energy
0905 07f7 92 27                          SBCA        STORE1+$1   ; Subtract most significant half of loss 
0906 07f9 a7 01                          STAA        $01,X       ; Return to storage
0907 07fb 39                             RTS                     ;  
0908                          
0909 07fc de 68              TOSD        LDX         PDVSE       ; Set pointer to shield energy
0910 07fe 20 02                          BRA         TO1         ; Add energy to shields
0911                         
0912 0800 de 66              TOMN        LDX         PDVME       ; Set pointer to main energy 
0913 0802 a6 00              TO1         LDAA        0,X         ; Fetch least significant half of energy 
0914 0804 9b 26                          ADDA        STORE1      ; Add least significant half of loss
0915 0806 a7 00                          STAA        0,X         ; Return to storage
0916 0808 a6 01                          LDAA        $01,X       ; Fetch most significant half of energy 
0917 080a 99 27                          ADCA        STORE1+$1   ; Add most significant half of loss
0918 080c a7 01                          STAA        $01,X       ; Return to storage
0919 080e 39                             RTS                     ; 
0920                         
0921 080f 5d                 DVD         TSTB                    ; Divide the double
0922 0810 76 00 27                       ROR         STORE1+$1   ;  precision value
0923 0813 76 00 26                       ROR         STORE1      ;   by two the number
0924 0816 5a                             DECB                    ;    of times indicated in B
0925 0817 26 f6                          BNE         DVD         ; 
0926 0819 39                 ELOS1       RTS                     ; Return
0927 081a 7e 06 5d           EOUT1       JMP         EOUT        ; 
