1607                         ; The shield routine transfers energy between the main energy 
1608                         ; supply and the protective shields as designated by the operator. The 
1609                         ; routine begins by requesting the operator to enter the amount of 
1610                         ; energy to be transferred. The EIN routine is called to input the 
1611                         ; energy from the input device. The input is then converted to its 
1612                         ; binary value and the sign of the input is checked. If a minus sign was 
1613                         ; entered preceeding the energy input, the energy is transferred from 
1614                         ; the shield energy to the main energy storage. If only the four digits 
1615                         ; are entered, the transfer of energy goes from the main supply to the 
1616                         ; shields by jumping to the routine labeled POS. In either case, the 
1617                         ; supply from which the energy is to be taken is checked to determine 
1618                         ; whether there is enough energy for the transfer. If there is not 
1619                         ; enough, a message is output to inform the operator, and the routine 
1620                         ; returns to the command input routine. If there is sufficient energy, 
1621                         ; the transfer will be completed and the program will return to the 
1622                         ; command input routine. This routine begins at the label SHEN.
1623                         
1624 0c13 ce 03 30           SHEN        LDX         #MSG21      ; Print SHIELD ENERGY 
1625 0c16 bd 05 06                       JSR         MSG         ;  TRANSFER =
1626 0c19 bd 08 28                       JSR         EIN         ; Input energy amount
1627 0c1c 2b f5                          BMI         SHEN        ; Invalid input, try again 
1628                         
1629 0c1e bd 05 8a                       JSR         DCBN        ; Convert to binary
1630 0c21 de 28                          LDX         STORE2      ; Transfer binary amount for
1631 0c23 df 26                          STX         STORE1      ;  routines to follow 
1632 0c25 96 55                          LDAA        DGT5TH      ; Test if have sign
1633 0c27 27 0d                          BEQ         POS         ; No, transfer main to shields
1634 0c29 bd 07 d8                       JSR         CKSD        ; Check shield energy
1635 0c2c 25 15                          BCS         NE          ; Not enough, print message
1636 0c2e bd 07 e9                       JSR         FMSD        ; Subtract from shields
1637 0c31 bd 08 00                       JSR         TOMN        ; Add to main
1638 0c34 20 13                          BRA         SHEN1       ; Input new command
1639                         
1640 0c36 bd 07 dc           POS         JSR         CKMN        ; Check main energy
1641 0c39 25 08                          BCS         NE          ; Not enough, display message
1642 0c3b bd 07 ed                       JSR         FMMN        ; Subtract from main 
1643 0c3e bd 07 fc                       JSR         TOSD        ; Add to shields 
1644 0c41 20 06                          BRA         SHEN1       ; Input new command 
1645                         
1646 0c43 ce 03 4c           NE          LDX         #MSG22      ; Print NOT ENOUGH 
1647 0c46 bd 05 06                       JSR         MSG         ;  ENERGY 
1648 0c49 7e 0b 39           SHEN1       JMP         CMND        ; Input new command 
