1798 0d3c df 26                          STX         STORE1      ; Of energy to delete 
1799 0d3e bd 07 dc                       JSR         CKMN        ; Enough in main supply? 
1800 0d41 24 03                          BCC         TRPD1       ; Yes, continue 
1801 0d43 7e 0c 43                       JMP         NE          ; No, report not enough energy 
