1904 0de2 de 60                          LDX         PSLAS1      ; Pointer to alien ship no. 1 position 
1905 0de4 bd 0d fb                       JSR         ASPH        ; Fire phasor at alien ship no. 1
1906 0de7 de 6c                          LDX         PVASE2      ; Fetch pointer to alien ship no. 2 energy 
1907 0de9 df 24                          STX         PNTR3       ; Save pointer for ASPH routine 
1908 0deb de 62                          LDX         PSLAS2      ; Pointer to alien ship no. 2 position 
1909 0ded bd 0d fb                       JSR         ASPH        ; Fire phasor at alien ship no. 2 
